dav1d — BSD 2-Clause
--------------------
AV1 decoding uses libdav1d (VideoLAN), pinned to 1.5.1, statically linked.
FFmpeg's built-in av1 decoder is hardware-only; libdav1d provides software AV1.
License (BSD 2-Clause): bundled with the release tarball as COPYING.dav1d;
upstream at https://code.videolan.org/videolan/dav1d/-/blob/master/COPYING

